[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4020.87, "timestamp": "01:07:00", "text": "或許我該置頂一則評論之類的，看看是不是一場業餘摔角比賽直播。如果我像計畫一那樣正式直播那款遊戲，標題大概會是「計畫一 #1 首播」或「計畫一試玩計畫一」或「第一次嘗試這款遊戲」之類的，還會配上正式的計畫一縮圖"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4042.384, "timestamp": "01:07:22", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I. DON’T. CARE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4049.309, "timestamp": "01:07:29", "text": "等等。如果直播是在"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4051.476, "timestamp": "01:07:31", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "YOU NEED SLEEP? YOU GO SLEEP"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4054.23, "timestamp": "01:07:34", "text": "Twitch 上，或者在 YouTube 上，我會把它標記為 18+ 直播，對吧？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4060.684, "timestamp": "01:07:40", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "YOU SLEEP WHEN YOU WANT."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4063.99, "timestamp": "01:07:43", "text": "但我們現在是在進行 Joathon 直播，不是那種想做什麼就做什麼的直播，內容類型也會隨著時間而改變，對吧？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4076.241, "timestamp": "01:07:56", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "why not put that thing"}]